; World-cone collider for the 18" standard cone (REAL-005).
; Origin = the cone piece's centre (piece bottom at y = -0.2286).
; Taper: frustum r 0.12 m -> 0.04 m from the base top to the tip.
; Base: square rubber base 0.286 x 0.028 x 0.286 m.
; world_cone.gd copies every CollisionShape3D child into the cone's RigidBody3D.
; To use an Asset Manager "-col" mesh later, replace these children with that shape.

